### Status Level Management - Admin Service
### These endpoints proxy to token-service

@baseUrl = http://localhost:28080
@token = {{token}}

### Get All Status Levels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orchestration/status-levels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Status Level by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orchestration/status-levels/SILVER
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Status Level - SILVER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orchestration/status-levels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelName": "Legendery",
  "minApartBalance": 5000,
  "apBoostPerHour": 2,
  "includesProAutoMining": false,
  "displayOrder": 0,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Silver / 5k -> +2 AP/hr"
}

### Create Status Level - GOLD
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orchestration/status-levels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelName": "GOLD",
  "minApartBalance": 20000,
  "apBoostPerHour": 3,
  "includesProAutoMining": false,
  "displayOrder": 1,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Gold / 20k -> +3 AP/hr"
}

### Create Status Level - PLATINUM
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orchestration/status-levels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelName": "PLATINUM",
  "minApartBalance": 50000,
  "apBoostPerHour": 5,
  "includesProAutoMining": true,
  "displayOrder": 2,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Platinum / 50k -> +5 AP/hr + pro auto-mining"
}

### Create Status Level - ELITE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orchestration/status-levels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelName": "ELITE",
  "minApartBalance": 100000,
  "apBoostPerHour": 7.77,
  "includesProAutoMining": true,
  "displayOrder": 3,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Elite / 100k -> +7.77 AP/hr + pro auto-mining"
}

### Update Status Level
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orchestration/status-levels/SILVER
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelName": "SILVER",
  "minApartBalance": 5000,
  "apBoostPerHour": 2.5,
  "includesProAutoMining": false,
  "displayOrder": 0,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Silver / 5k -> +2.5 AP/hr (updated)"
}

### Delete Status Level
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orchestration/status-levels/ELITE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

